{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkzan Adventure</strong> is a Medieval Arcade RPG full of humor, fast-paced action, and unusual characters. Explore mysterious lands, face the cult of Darkzan, and uncover bizarre events while playing solo, in co-op, or even in idle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/646703f2b42eb10cba224251f9321d07.poster.avif?t=1769452032\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/646703f2b42eb10cba224251f9321d07.webm?t=1769452032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/646703f2b42eb10cba224251f9321d07.mp4?t=1769452032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Modes</strong><br><strong>Solo Campaign</strong> \u2014 You and 3 allies controlled by AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op</strong> \u2014 Form teams and combine skills with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Adventure</strong> \u2014 Let your heroes fight on their own and come back to collect rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/89bd7f488a87b5c097d90eb6a317bd33.poster.avif?t=1769452032\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/89bd7f488a87b5c097d90eb6a317bd33.webm?t=1769452032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/89bd7f488a87b5c097d90eb6a317bd33.mp4?t=1769452032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Why play?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique characters with different abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events: enemy hordes, friendly travelers, wandering merchants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent updates with more content and seasonal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings, achievements, and character customization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/24801c0b5b3c5579900d58350bca853a.poster.avif?t=1769452032\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/24801c0b5b3c5579900d58350bca853a.webm?t=1769452032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050600/extras/24801c0b5b3c5579900d58350bca853a.mp4?t=1769452032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Forbidden Knowledge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4050600/d2310ac1412498cf093624e64ba0ec3ea548a001.jpg"},{"name":"Rip n Tear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4050600/d5142e18841dd85862d2364acbfe9da7483dfed0.jpg"},{"name":"Touch Grass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4050600/789a364cb0dd71c7486c6fd69f11771e49f16507.jpg"},{"name":"Strider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4050600/98eedd019202518d7d4cae2719d7643835766924.jpg"},{"name":"Full Pocket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4050600/e62f43ffec65102dde68fc759f38d158dccf1363.jpg"},{"name":"The Treant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c